{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/e201dec13e6fac70820f2dbf314fac44.avif?t=1769811807\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras_big/e201dec13e6fac70820f2dbf314fac44.avif?t=1769811807 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/083b05f2d870c46727030ab1fcaf822d.avif?t=1769811807\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of an adorable but mischievous pup! Left alone, this is your chance to explore, collect, and smash your way through 5 vibrant, interactive environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/eb4228e0bc680e83077f78bb1457eac6.poster.avif?t=1769811807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/eb4228e0bc680e83077f78bb1457eac6.webm?t=1769811807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/eb4228e0bc680e83077f78bb1457eac6.mp4?t=1769811807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and dig into a howl-arious list of fun-filled shenanigans in an attempt to impress your feathered friends, who reward you with \u2728Mischievous Badges\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's sure to be a pawsitively unforgettable day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/81c53ee3e854e5e50cfe1d0a5fd58b9e.avif?t=1769811807\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc36 Engaging single-player adventure </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Vibrant 3D cartoon-style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde6 Adorable pawjama outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Puzzles to solve using found items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Interactive environments  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/f3a74a470bb81e00ccc0207b5d7fd158.poster.avif?t=1769811807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/f3a74a470bb81e00ccc0207b5d7fd158.webm?t=1769811807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/f3a74a470bb81e00ccc0207b5d7fd158.mp4?t=1769811807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Earn mischievous badges for being naughty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Impress your feathered friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 You can pee everywhere! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fun for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/a11213674a0cd533b414f31e3151f7b8.poster.avif?t=1769811807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/a11213674a0cd533b414f31e3151f